request.description:
[PRODUCT DECISION 2026-09-11] 3 dimensions in ONE request -> 3 INDEPENDENT reports, not one combined document. Each becomes its own orchestration run, own cooldown key, own report. "Entity" here still redirects that ONE unit to a full fixed_holistic report - Location/Act are unaffected plain dimension_selection reports.

202 -> { "reports": [
  { dimension: "Location", reportType: "dimension_selection", status: "queued", runId, streamUrl },
  { dimension: "Entity",   reportType: "fixed_holistic",      status: "queued", runId, streamUrl },
  { dimension: "Act",      reportType: "dimension_selection", status: "cooldown", nextAvailableUtc }
] }

Best-effort: one dimension on cooldown never blocks the others. Use dimension/reportType per entry to map a result back to the checkbox the user ticked.
